    "forward-consolidation": {
      "name": "forward-consolidation",
      "description": "Reduce ~15 forward method variants in network.rs to 2-3 core methods using shared dispatch logic, and unify train_epoch/evaluate forward dispatch",
      "issue_ids": [
        "review::.::holistic::logic_clarity::duplicated_time_since_spike_branches",
        "review::.::holistic::ai_generated_debt::duplicated_forward_dispatch",
        "review::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::forward_method_proliferation",
        "review::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::init_state_forward_mismatch_risk",
        "review::.::holistic::design_coherence::duplicated_forward_step_variants",
        "review::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::forward_full_physics_duplication",
        "review::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::forward_quantized_full_monolith",
        "review::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::forward_variant_duplication",
        "review::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::init_state_parallel_variants",
        "review::.::holistic::naming_quality::forward_variant_explosion"
      ],
      "created_at": "2026-03-18T18:48:26+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-03-18T18:57:18+00:00",
      "auto": false,
      "cluster_key": "",
      "action": null,
      "action_type": "manual_fix",
      "execution_policy": "planned_only",
      "execution_status": "active",
      "user_modified": true,
      "action_steps": [
        {
          "title": "Create unified forward dispatch in network.rs",
          "detail": "In src/network/network.rs there are 15 forward method variants (lines 197-1097): forward_step, forward_step_quantized, forward, forward_step_with_dt, forward_quantized, forward_quantized_full, forward_with_dt, forward_step_with_pulse, forward_with_pulse, forward_step_with_adaptation, forward_with_adaptation, forward_noisy, forward_with_analog, forward_with_encoding, forward_traced. Create a ForwardConfig struct with fields: quant_bits, input_quant_bits, noise_params, dt_override, use_pulse, use_adaptation, analog_gain, encoder, trace. Replace the 15 variants with forward_step_configured(input, state, config) and forward_configured(input, num_steps, config). The run_forward_loop helper at line 480 already shows the consolidation pattern.",
          "effort": "large",
          "issue_refs": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Unify train_epoch and evaluate forward dispatch",
          "detail": "In src/training.rs, train_epoch() lines 403-438 has a 6-branch if/else chain selecting forward variant (noisy, adaptation, encoding, analog, input_quant, quantized). evaluate() lines 481-508 duplicates 4 of these branches (noisy, encoding, input_quant, quantized) but is missing adaptation and analog branches. After step 1 creates ForwardConfig, replace both dispatch chains with a single build_forward_config() method on Trainer that produces the ForwardConfig from Trainer fields, then call network.forward_configured(images, num_steps, config) in both train_epoch and evaluate.",
          "effort": "medium",
          "issue_refs": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Consolidate init_state variants",
          "detail": "In src/network/network.rs lines 158-192, there are 4 init_state variants: init_state (line 159), init_state_with_pulse (line 168), init_state_with_adaptation (line 177), init_state_full (line 186). Similarly in src/neurons/lif/builder.rs lines 171-198: init_state, init_state_with_pulse, init_state_with_adaptation, init_state_full, init_state_with_hardware_timing. Merge into a single init_state(batch_size, config: &ForwardConfig) that inspects the config to decide which LeakyState constructor to call. Delete the 4 Network-level variants and 5 Leaky-level variants after consolidation.",
          "effort": "small",
          "issue_refs": []
        }
      ],
      "depends_on_clusters": [
        "dead-code-cleanup"
      ]
    },
