          "detail": "argmax() is duplicated at src/cli/commands/raster.rs line 35 and src/bin/spike_raster_dump.rs line 62 (identical implementations). collect_events() is duplicated at src/cli/commands/raster.rs line 44 and src/bin/spike_raster_dump.rs line 71 (identical implementations). RasterSample and RasterDump structs are also duplicated between these two files (raster.rs lines 12-33, spike_raster_dump.rs lines 39-60). Move argmax and collect_events functions from src/cli/commands/raster.rs into src/lib.rs as pub utility functions (or add to existing src/tensor.rs which already has utility functions). Then update both src/cli/commands/raster.rs and src/bin/spike_raster_dump.rs to import from the shared location instead of defining locally.",
          "effort": "small",
          "issue_refs": []
        }
      ]
    },
