      "stages": {
        "observe": {
          "stage": "observe",
          "report": "## OBSERVE Stage Report \u2014 Issue-by-Issue Code Verification\n\nAll 61 review issues verified by reading source code. Verdicts below cite specific files, lines, and code evidence.\n\n### physics_mode_field_sprawl [review::.::holistic::abstraction_fitness::physics_mode_field_sprawl]\nVerdict: genuine. NeuronMode::Physics has 11 inline fields (mode.rs lines 37-74). 12 accessor methods repeat match arms. PhysicsParams struct exists at line 141 with Default+From but isn't used by NeuronMode::Physics.\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/mode.rs\nRecommendation: Refactor NeuronMode::Physics to wrap PhysicsParams.\n\n### tensor_wrapper_underutilized [review::.::holistic::abstraction_fitness::tensor_wrapper_underutilized]\nVerdict: genuine. Tensor2D/Tensor1D in tensor.rs only used for cross_entropy_loss. Network forward/backward uses raw ndarray Array2/Array1 everywhere.\nFiles: src/tensor.rs, src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Remove dead Tensor types or commit to using them.\n\n### builder_boilerplate_ignores_physicsparams [review::.::holistic::ai_generated_debt::builder_boilerplate_ignores_physicsparams]\nVerdict: genuine. builder.rs new_physics (line 41), new_physics_with_pulse (line 66), new_physics_with_threshold_adaptation (line 97) each repeat 11-field NeuronMode::Physics init. PhysicsParams{..Default::default()}.into() available but unused.\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/builder.rs, src/neurons/lif/mode.rs\nRecommendation: Use PhysicsParams pattern in constructors.\n\n### cli_checkpoint_boilerplate [review::.::holistic::ai_generated_debt::cli_checkpoint_boilerplate]\nVerdict: genuine. Checkpoint load + dataset setup ~20 lines duplicated across animate.rs, raster.rs, evaluate.rs, inspect.rs, dashboard.rs.\nFiles: src/cli/commands/animate.rs, src/cli/commands/raster.rs\nRecommendation: Extract shared helper.\n\n### duplicated_forward_dispatch [review::.::holistic::ai_generated_debt::duplicated_forward_dispatch]\nVerdict: genuine. train_epoch (training.rs lines 403-439) has 6-branch dispatch. evaluate (lines 481-508) duplicates 4 branches. Missing adaptation/analog in evaluate may be a bug.\nFiles: src/training.rs\nRecommendation: Extract dispatch_forward method.\n\n### restating_builder_docstrings [review::.::holistic::ai_generated_debt::restating_builder_docstrings]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. Only 3 builder methods with 1-line doc comments in builder.rs lines 128-153.\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/builder.rs\nRecommendation: Skip.\n\n### dead_split_sign_parameter [review::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::dead_split_sign_parameter]\nVerdict: genuine. network.rs line 349 accepts split_sign, line 367 discards with let _ = split_sign.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Remove parameter.\n\n### forward_method_proliferation [review::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::forward_method_proliferation]\nVerdict: genuine. ~15 public forward variants in network.rs confirmed.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Consolidate with ForwardOptions struct.\n\n### init_state_forward_mismatch_risk [review::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::init_state_forward_mismatch_risk]\nVerdict: genuine. 4 init_state variants (lines 159-192) must be paired with matching forward variants. No compile guard.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Auto-initialize state in forward methods.\n\n### neuron_test_12_params [review::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::neuron_test_12_params]\nVerdict: genuine. run_neuron_test takes exactly 12 positional params (neuron_test.rs line 3). All f32 except last.\nFiles: src/cli/commands/neuron_test.rs\nRecommendation: Group into struct. Low priority (internal CLI).\n\n### unsanitized_checkpoint_path [review::.::holistic::authorization_consistency::unsanitized_checkpoint_path]\nVerdict: genuine. server.rs line 288: PathBuf::from(&path) from client input, no validation.\nFiles: src/web/server.rs\nRecommendation: Validate path within allowed directory.\n\n### web_server_binds_all_interfaces [review::.::holistic::authorization_consistency::web_server_binds_all_interfaces]\nVerdict: genuine. server.rs line 104: \"0.0.0.0:{}\" confirmed. No auth.\nFiles: src/web/server.rs\nRecommendation: Change to 127.0.0.1.\n\n### architecture_mode_string [review::.::holistic::contract_coherence::architecture_mode_string]\nVerdict: genuine. checkpoint.rs line 54: pub mode: String. OperationMode enum exists in config.rs with serde support.\nFiles: src/checkpoint.rs, src/config.rs\nRecommendation: Change to OperationMode.\n\n### backward_beta_physics_coupling [review::.::holistic::contract_coherence::backward_beta_physics_coupling]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. backward.rs line 20 uses self.beta, which IS correct \u2014 set to exp(-dt/tau_m) during construction (builder.rs line 42).\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/backward.rs, src/neurons/lif/builder.rs\nRecommendation: Skip. Behavior is correct.\n\n### network_new_beta_misleading [review::.::holistic::contract_coherence::network_new_beta_misleading]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. Network::new() beta param defaults to Physics mode (network.rs line 30-46). Only used in tests.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Skip. Low confusion risk.\n\n### duplicated_argmax_collect_events [review::.::holistic::convention_outlier::duplicated_argmax_collect_events]\nVerdict: genuine. Exact duplicates: bin/spike_raster_dump.rs lines 62-81 = cli/commands/raster.rs lines 35-53.\nFiles: src/bin/spike_raster_dump.rs, src/cli/commands/raster.rs\nRecommendation: Extract to shared module.\n\n### get_prefix_on_rust_getters [review::.::holistic::convention_outlier::get_prefix_on_rust_getters]\nVerdict: genuine. 12+ get_ prefixed methods across config.rs, training.rs, builder.rs, simulation.rs.\nFiles: src/config.rs, src/training.rs, src/neurons/lif/builder.rs, src/web/simulation.rs\nRecommendation: Rename to drop get_.\n\n### import_convention_split [review::.::holistic::convention_outlier::import_convention_split]\nVerdict: genuine. 35+ gilgamesh:: imports across all 12 CLI command files, vs crate:: everywhere else.\nFiles: src/cli/commands/\nRecommendation: Standardize to crate::.\n\n### network_constructor_vs_builder [review::.::holistic::convention_outlier::network_constructor_vs_builder]\nVerdict: genuine. Network has 4 constructors (lines 29-129) vs Leaky's builder pattern.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs, src/neurons/lif/builder.rs\nRecommendation: Consolidate constructors.\n\n### cli_gilgamesh_import_cycle [review::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::cli_gilgamesh_import_cycle]\nVerdict: exaggerated. Not a real cycle \u2014 standard Rust binary/library crate pattern. But crate:: is preferred.\nFiles: src/cli/commands/train.rs\nRecommendation: Fix via import cleanup.\n\n### spice_hub_module [review::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::spice_hub_module]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. 1456 LOC but coherent domain module. Splitting adds navigation overhead without value.\nFiles: src/spice.rs\nRecommendation: Skip.\n\n### web_bidirectional_coupling [review::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::web_bidirectional_coupling]\nVerdict: genuine. server.rs imports SimulationState, simulation.rs imports AppState. Real bidirectional dependency.\nFiles: src/web/server.rs, src/web/simulation.rs\nRecommendation: Extract AppState to web/state.rs.\n\n### web_bidirectional_dependency [review::.::holistic::dependency_health::web_bidirectional_dependency]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of web_bidirectional_coupling.\nFiles: src/web/server.rs, src/web/simulation.rs\nRecommendation: Merge with web_bidirectional_coupling.\n\n### widespread_unused_imports [review::.::holistic::dependency_health::widespread_unused_imports]\nVerdict: genuine. auto/unused cluster has 125 items, plausible from feature-gated code.\nFiles: src/cli/commands/animate.rs\nRecommendation: Use autofix.\n\n### checkpoint_loading_boilerplate [review::.::holistic::design_coherence::checkpoint_loading_boilerplate]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of cli_checkpoint_boilerplate. Same 5-command duplication.\nFiles: src/cli/commands/animate.rs, src/cli/commands/raster.rs\nRecommendation: Merge with cli_checkpoint_boilerplate.\n\n### combinatorial_network_constructors [review::.::holistic::design_coherence::combinatorial_network_constructors]\nVerdict: genuine. 4 near-identical constructors (network.rs lines 29-129).\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Consolidate.\n\n### duplicated_forward_step_variants [review::.::holistic::design_coherence::duplicated_forward_step_variants]\nVerdict: genuine. 5 forward_step_* methods repeat fc1->lif1->fc2->lif2. run_forward_loop only used by 2 of 5.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Extend run_forward_loop.\n\n### hardcoded_optimizer_fields [review::.::holistic::design_coherence::hardcoded_optimizer_fields]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. 8 hardcoded moment fields for 2 layers. Network is architecturally fixed at 2 layers for chip deployment.\nFiles: src/training.rs\nRecommendation: Skip. 2-layer architecture is intentional.\n\n### raster_dump_duplication [review::.::holistic::design_coherence::raster_dump_duplication]\nVerdict: genuine. bin/spike_raster_dump.rs duplicates 80+ lines from cli/commands/raster.rs.\nFiles: src/bin/spike_raster_dump.rs, src/cli/commands/raster.rs\nRecommendation: Remove bin/ version.\n\n### verbose_physics_mode_construction [review::.::holistic::design_coherence::verbose_physics_mode_construction]\nVerdict: genuine. Same root cause as physics_mode_field_sprawl.\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/mode.rs, src/neurons/lif/builder.rs\nRecommendation: Merge with PhysicsParams cluster.\n\n### broadcast_silent_drop [review::.::holistic::error_consistency::broadcast_silent_drop]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. server.rs line 49: let _ = self.tx.send(msg). Fails when no subscribers \u2014 expected behavior.\nFiles: src/web/server.rs\nRecommendation: Skip.\n\n### network_unwrap_spiking_input_state [review::.::holistic::error_consistency::network_unwrap_spiking_input_state]\nVerdict: genuine. network.rs lines 395-396 unwrap Options guarded by if self.spiking_input. Structurally safe but expect() preferred.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Change to expect(). Low priority.\n\n### simulation_unwrap_optional_state [review::.::holistic::error_consistency::simulation_unwrap_optional_state]\nVerdict: exaggerated. simulation.rs unwraps on lines 335/349 are guarded by has_network/has_images check on line 330. Lines 353/358 use unwrap_or_else.\nFiles: src/web/simulation.rs\nRecommendation: Low priority. Guarded unwraps.\n\n### web_server_unwrap_serialization [review::.::holistic::error_consistency::web_server_unwrap_serialization]\nVerdict: genuine. server.rs lines 139, 144, 152 unwrap serde_json::to_string. Panic in async task kills connection.\nFiles: src/web/server.rs\nRecommendation: Use expect() or propagate.\n\n### bin_duplicates_cli_commands [review::.::holistic::high_level_elegance::bin_duplicates_cli_commands]\nVerdict: genuine. bin/spike_raster_dump.rs is superseded by CLI command version.\nFiles: src/bin/spike_raster_dump.rs, src/cli/commands/raster.rs\nRecommendation: Remove bin version.\n\n### flat_src_root_mixed_concerns [review::.::holistic::high_level_elegance::flat_src_root_mixed_concerns]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. 14 files at src/ root. Manageable for this codebase size.\nFiles: src/\nRecommendation: Skip.\n\n### redundant_physics_mode_toggle [review::.::holistic::incomplete_migration::redundant_physics_mode_toggle]\nVerdict: genuine. PhysicsConfig.enabled (config.rs line 181) redundant with Config.mode == OperationMode::Physics.\nFiles: src/config.rs\nRecommendation: Remove PhysicsConfig.enabled.\n\n### rayon_global_pool_silent_ignore [review::.::holistic::initialization_coupling::rayon_global_pool_silent_ignore]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. training.rs line 321-322: .build_global().ok(). Only failure is pool-already-initialized.\nFiles: src/training.rs\nRecommendation: Skip.\n\n### dead_spike_grad_local [review::.::holistic::logic_clarity::dead_spike_grad_local]\nVerdict: genuine. network.rs line 381 creates spike_grad, line 472 discards with let _ = spike_grad.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Remove dead variable.\n\n### dead_split_sign_param [review::.::holistic::logic_clarity::dead_split_sign_param]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of dead_split_sign_parameter.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Merge with dead_split_sign_parameter.\n\n### duplicated_time_since_spike_branches [review::.::holistic::logic_clarity::duplicated_time_since_spike_branches]\nVerdict: genuine. forward.rs lines 73-100: two branches with identical spike-reset loop, differing only in initialization.\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/forward.rs\nRecommendation: Unify branches.\n\n### builder_struct_init_repetition [review::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::builder_struct_init_repetition]\nVerdict: genuine. Same as builder_boilerplate_ignores_physicsparams.\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/builder.rs\nRecommendation: Merge into PhysicsParams cluster.\n\n### count_correct_unwrap_on_partial_cmp [review::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::count_correct_unwrap_on_partial_cmp]\nVerdict: genuine. training.rs line 265: partial_cmp(b).unwrap() panics on NaN.\nFiles: src/training.rs\nRecommendation: Use unwrap_or(Ordering::Equal).\n\n### forward_full_physics_duplication [review::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::forward_full_physics_duplication]\nVerdict: genuine. forward_full_physics (forward.rs lines 345-400) duplicates from forward_with_pulse and forward_with_adaptation.\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/forward.rs\nRecommendation: Extract composable helpers.\n\n### forward_quantized_full_monolith [review::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::forward_quantized_full_monolith]\nVerdict: genuine. ~130-line inline loop in forward_quantized_full (network.rs lines 344-475).\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Extract spiking input encoding helper.\n\n### config_to_network_scattered [review::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::config_to_network_scattered]\nVerdict: genuine. Config-to-Network translation in cli/commands/train.rs, not centralized.\nFiles: src/cli/commands/train.rs, src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Add Network::from_config().\n\n### forward_variant_duplication [review::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::forward_variant_duplication]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of forward_quantized_full_monolith.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Merge with forward_quantized_full_monolith.\n\n### init_state_parallel_variants [review::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::init_state_parallel_variants]\nVerdict: genuine. 4 init_state methods (network.rs lines 159-192) mirror neuron mode variants.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Consolidate to single init_state().\n\n### network_constructor_proliferation [review::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::network_constructor_proliferation]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of combinatorial_network_constructors.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Merge.\n\n### forward_variant_explosion [review::.::holistic::naming_quality::forward_variant_explosion]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of forward_method_proliferation.\nFiles: src/network/network.rs\nRecommendation: Merge.\n\n### get_prefix_inconsistency [review::.::holistic::naming_quality::get_prefix_inconsistency]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of get_prefix_on_rust_getters.\nFiles: src/config.rs, src/neurons/lif/builder.rs\nRecommendation: Merge.\n\n### flat_src_root_mixed_concerns (package_organization) [review::.::holistic::package_organization::flat_src_root_mixed_concerns]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. Duplicate of high_level_elegance version.\nFiles: src/\nRecommendation: Skip.\n\n### hardware_config_name_collision [review::.::holistic::package_organization::hardware_config_name_collision]\nVerdict: genuine. config.rs line 228 and hardware.rs line 29 both define HardwareConfig with different purposes.\nFiles: src/config.rs, src/hardware.rs\nRecommendation: Rename one.\n\n### cli_layer_untested [review::.::holistic::test_strategy::cli_layer_untested]\nVerdict: genuine. Zero #[cfg(test)] in any cli/ file. 12 command files with 0 tests.\nFiles: src/cli/commands/\nRecommendation: Add smoke tests.\n\n### frontend_zero_tests [review::.::holistic::test_strategy::frontend_zero_tests]\nVerdict: genuine. No test files in frontend/.\nFiles: frontend/\nRecommendation: Add vitest.\n\n### no_integration_tests [review::.::holistic::test_strategy::no_integration_tests]\nVerdict: genuine. No tests/ directory at project root.\nFiles: project root\nRecommendation: Add integration tests.\n\n### training_loop_untested [review::.::holistic::test_strategy::training_loop_untested]\nVerdict: genuine. training.rs has #[cfg(test)] at line 551 but critical paths like train_epoch need more coverage.\nFiles: src/training.rs\nRecommendation: Add focused unit tests.\n\n### web_layer_untested [review::.::holistic::test_strategy::web_layer_untested]\nVerdict: genuine. No tests in web/server.rs or web/simulation.rs.\nFiles: src/web/server.rs, src/web/simulation.rs\nRecommendation: Add tests for message handling.\n\n### architecture_mode_string_type [review::.::holistic::type_safety::architecture_mode_string_type]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of architecture_mode_string.\nFiles: src/checkpoint.rs\nRecommendation: Merge.\n\n### neuron_mode_physics_flat_fields [review::.::holistic::type_safety::neuron_mode_physics_flat_fields]\nVerdict: genuine. Duplicate of physics_mode_field_sprawl.\nFiles: src/neurons/lif/mode.rs\nRecommendation: Merge.\n\n### simulation_state_wide_options [review::.::holistic::type_safety::simulation_state_wide_options]\nVerdict: not-worth-it. Options in SimulationState (lines 29-33) properly handled with guards (line 330).\nFiles: src/web/simulation.rs\nRecommendation: Skip.\n\n### Auto-Cluster Verdicts\n\n- cluster: auto/unused (125 items)\n  verdict: actionable, sample_count: 5, false_positive_rate: 0.2\n  recommendation: promote\n\n- cluster: auto/rust_import_hygiene (42 items)\n  verdict: actionable, sample_count: 5, false_positive_rate: 0.0\n  recommendation: promote\n\n- cluster: auto/test_coverage-untested_module (18 items)\n  verdict: low-value, sample_count: 5, false_positive_rate: 0.0\n  recommendation: skip (CLI glue code, already covered by test_strategy review issues)\n\n- cluster: auto/test_coverage-transitive_only (17 items)\n  verdict: low-value, sample_count: 5, false_positive_rate: 0.0\n  recommendation: skip (small supporting types covered transitively)\n\n- cluster: auto/stale_exclude (11 items)\n  verdict: mostly-false-positives, sample_count: 5, false_positive_rate: 0.8\n  recommendation: skip (data directories referenced at runtime, not code imports)\n\n### Summary Statistics\n- Genuine: 40 issues\n- Not-worth-it: 10 issues (restating_builder_docstrings, backward_beta_physics_coupling, network_new_beta_misleading, spice_hub_module, broadcast_silent_drop, hardcoded_optimizer_fields, flat_src_root_mixed_concerns x2, rayon_global_pool_silent_ignore, simulation_state_wide_options)\n- Exaggerated: 2 issues (cli_gilgamesh_import_cycle, simulation_unwrap_optional_state)\n- Duplicate reports: ~15 issues pointing to same root causes\n- False positive: 0 issues",
