          "report": "## REFLECT Stage Report\n\n### Prior Work Assessment\nNo prior desloppify runs have modified this codebase. Git history shows no commits addressing any of the 61 reported issues. All issues are fresh and unaddressed.\n\n### Observe Report Accuracy\nVerified every issue category by reading source code. The observe report is highly accurate with correct file references and line numbers. Key verifications:\n- physics_mode_field_sprawl: CONFIRMED. mode.rs lines 37-74 have 11 inline fields. PhysicsParams at line 141 unused by enum variant.\n- builder_boilerplate_ignores_physicsparams: CONFIRMED. builder.rs lines 49-61, 80-92, 112-124 repeat 11-field init.\n- dead_split_sign_parameter: CONFIRMED. network.rs line 349 accepts, line 367 discards.\n- dead_spike_grad_local: CONFIRMED. network.rs line 381 creates, line 472 discards.\n- web_server_binds_all_interfaces: CONFIRMED. server.rs line 104 binds 0.0.0.0.\n- unsanitized_checkpoint_path: CONFIRMED. server.rs line 288 no validation.\n- duplicated_forward_dispatch: CONFIRMED. train_epoch 6-branch, evaluate 4-branch. Missing adaptation/analog in evaluate.\n- import_convention_split: CONFIRMED. 50+ gilgamesh:: imports in CLI commands.\n- count_correct_unwrap_on_partial_cmp: CONFIRMED. training.rs line 265 panics on NaN.\n- hardware_config_name_collision: CONFIRMED. Two HardwareConfig structs.\n- web_bidirectional_coupling: CONFIRMED. server.rs imports SimulationState, simulation.rs imports AppState.\n- architecture_mode_string: CONFIRMED. checkpoint.rs line 54 String instead of enum.\n- forward_method_proliferation: CONFIRMED. ~15 forward variants.\n- combinatorial_network_constructors: CONFIRMED. 4 constructors lines 29-129.\n\n### Duplicate Clusters\n11 root-cause clusters identified spanning ~15 duplicate reports. See Coverage Ledger.\n\n## Coverage Ledger\n\n- physics_mode_field_sprawl -> cluster \"physics-params-refactor\"\n- tensor_wrapper_underutilized -> cluster \"dead-code-cleanup\"\n- builder_bo